# Only the published site is tracked: index.html, historia/, kpp/.
#
# Everything below stays local. docs/ holds the source PDFs and harvested
# answer keys (third-party material we don't redistribute); tools/ builds the
# test data from them; SOURCES.md records where the key came from.
# Keep a backup of these — without them the question base cannot be rebuilt.
docs/
tools/
SOURCES.md
__pycache__/

# The test data, withdrawn from the published site — mistakes were found in
# the key. Kept locally so it can be corrected; re-track once verified.
#
#   questions.js         the CEM bank, frozen and checksummed; does not change
#   answers.js           the key, rebuilt as often as needed
#   answers-manual.json  answers settled by hand; they outrank the vote
kpp/questions.js
kpp/answers.js
kpp/answers-manual.json

# Unpublished working copy of the test: fixed CEM order, used to check the key
# question by question against the official PDF. kpp/index.html stays the
# takedown notice until that check is finished.
kpp/review.html
